 "remarks": "Experience stunning views of Stamford and Scalzi Park from this 2 bedroom 2 bath Penthouse corner unit. Newly painted and carpeted bedrooms. Bamboo flooring featured in living and dining areas. Generous main bedroom features en-suite and large walk in closet with closet system. Large second bedroom with two closets. Private balcony with access from main living area and both bedrooms. Kitchen updated with hardwood cabinets and granite countertops.  Other features include in unit laundry, newer water heater and central air conditioning. The secure building also offers the added convenience of two elevators, gym and sauna.Parking includes deeded space in garage as well as unassigned parking in carport area. Building is pet friendly and close to train station and downtown amenities, restaurants and shopping. Easy access to 95 and Merritt Parkway. A rare find!",
